      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transparent scalability: because blocks never wait for\neach other, the same kernel runs unchanged on\nany GPU, which simply executes as many blocks\nat a time as it has room for; more SMs means\nfaster, never different.",
